{
  "detail": "loop detected: entity 'urn:V1' is held by an exclusive/redirect registration that resolves back to this broker",
  "status": 508,
  "title": "Loop Detected",
  "type": "https://uri.etsi.org/ngsi-ld/errors/LoopDetected"
}



05. Append urn:V1/attrs (POST) with Via cb-alias -> 508
=======================================================
HTTP/1.1 508 Loop Detected
Date: REGEX(.*)
Content-Type: application/json
Content-Length: 236

{
  "detail": "loop detected: entity 'urn:V1' is held by an exclusive/redirect registration that resolves back to this broker",
  "status": 508,
